WEBVTT

00:33:28.253 --> 00:33:31.056
and I always wanted to convince myself

00:33:31.080 --> 00:33:32.976
that this is just my life.

00:33:33.000 --> 00:33:35.456
I'm here for a purpose,

00:33:35.480 --> 00:33:38.616
and my purpose was to be an astronaut

00:33:38.640 --> 00:33:42.836
and complete our mission objectives.

00:33:42.860 --> 00:33:46.356
AG: It helped Scott stay focused,
and made the days pass faster.

00:33:46.380 --> 00:33:48.926
Psychologists find
that a mental trip to the future

00:33:48.950 --> 00:33:52.524
can help us think less about
the monotonous how of our days

00:33:52.548 --> 00:33:55.186
and more on the meaningful why.

00:33:55.210 --> 00:33:57.734
We're able to get out of
the dull weeds of the process

00:33:57.758 --> 00:34:00.716
and shift our attention
to an exciting purpose.